# Folder structure

Follow `docs/folder-structure.md`. Do not invent a different layout.

## `src/` top-level

Only these roots: `prisma/`, `modules/`, `common/`, `config/`, `app.module.ts`, `main.ts`.

Allowed extras: `app.controller.ts`, `app.service.ts`, `generated/` (Prisma client, i18n types), `i18n/` (translation catalogs).

## Feature modules

Put domain code in `src/modules/<name>/`:

```
src/modules/<name>/
  dto/
  <name>.controller.ts
  <name>.service.ts
  <name>.module.ts
```

Auth also has `guards/` and `strategies/`. Do not add feature modules next to `src/app.module.ts`.

## `src/common/`

Cross-cutting code only, in: `decorators/`, `dto/`, `filters/`, `guards/`, `interceptors/`, `pipes/`, `utils/`.

`dto/` holds shared envelopes only (`api-response.dto.ts`). Feature request/response DTOs stay under `src/modules/<name>/dto/`.

## Do not

```
src/users/           ❌ use src/modules/users/
src/jwt/             ❌ use src/modules/auth/
src/common/foo.ts    ❌ use the matching common subfolder
```

Generate with `nest g module modules/users` (not `nest g module users`).
